WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.860
You brought me so many again!

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.990
Thanks, Yuzu.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.910
I know how much you love to read, Lilienne.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:28.210
Next time I come, I'll bring a whole bunch more, so you be sure to get all better.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:32.220
Oh yeah, I was just at the bookstore the other day...

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:36.590
You're so bright I can't see, Yuzu.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.450
Why would that dream come to me now?

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.760
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:44.010
That's the gist of things, so get ready for the recording tomorrow.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:48.180
E-Excuse me, what exactly was that the gist of?

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:51.020
Oh please, weren't you listening?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:55.610
I'm talking about the Four Star Label 
Dance Class music video we put out regularly.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:59.490
This time we're shaking things up and it'll star Yuzu-chan, plus one!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.910
It's gonna be a straight-up dance-dance pair.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.330
And now you've all been let in on Producer Sashita's vision!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.080
Yes! Together, you can do anything!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.870
Together, you can go to the ends of the earth!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.920
Together, you are the strongest!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.800
That sounds like a ton of fun!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:23.050
Let's get straight to the point and pick a partner for me!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:27.520
Understood, Yuzu-sama. We will immediately organize an audition for Dance Class—

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.180
And stick it in the trash.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:35.440
Right here, right now, whoever manages to dance to my groove gets to pair with me.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.400
Right here?!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.570
Right now?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.820
Go! Go! Go!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.580
I can't... go on...

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.710
I've hit my limit...

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:53.040
Hey girls, what's wrong?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.960
I'm still not even close to being danced out!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.630
She's ridiculous...

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.340
She's a dancing monster!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.550
Very well, Yuzu-sama.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:07.100
We will serve as your challengers!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.850
Maybe Katsura-senpai and Saya-senpai...

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.600
Yeah, they should be able to keep up with Yuzu-senpai's dancing!

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.950
Mikki, Saaya! Come on!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.370
More, more! Dance, dance!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.710
What are our options?

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.250
We have less than a day until the recording.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.420
Excuse me, Senpai?

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:44.010
You seem really worn out. 
Did something happen?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.010
Actually...

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.010
One, two, three, four.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.020
Two, two, three, four.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.560
I can't believe not a single member of 
Dance Class can keep up with Nikaidou!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.400
What a miscalculation!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.940
Guess this is what they call the solitude of genius.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:05.200
She may not be saying anything, but Nikaidou must be feeling ever so lonesome!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.030
This really puts us in a bind.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.290
One, two, three, four.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.450
Two, two, three, four.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.290
Three, two, three...

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.830
So that's what happened...

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.540
That sounds tough.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.170
At this point, we have only one option left!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.380
Bring it out.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.550
At once.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:25.880
Here it is.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.980
Hello! You've reached Haruka Luka! {I kept her star in last time, but it's too much to do it every time}{I think it wouldn't be that much if we had a prettier star in the font}

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.390
Telephone, telephone?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.520
Haruka, I'm sorry for the short notice, but we need you to return to Japan immediately!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.780
Okay, okay!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.320
Except...

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:50.370
I'm in the middle of filming a video for my LA dance school.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:53.540
They say it's gonna take an entire week!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.750
So it's like I'm at the South Pole!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.870
Huh? Hello?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.580
How could this be?

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:05.010
Now that it's come to this, we have no choice but to look outside of Dance Class.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.800
In that case, what about another S4 member?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.390
That would be impossible.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.680
Ako?

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.390
When did you get here?

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.520
Tick tick tick tick...

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.600
Ding-dong!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.650
According to my mental database,

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:25.570
Beauty Class's Yozora-senpai's schedule is packed with shooting for a photo collection.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:30.110
Song Class's Hime-senpai has solo concerts at the five big cities.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:38.160
And my Theater Class's Tsubasa-senpai is on site at Atami filming a four-hour special drama.{this isn't particularly lyger I think}

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:43.670
The three of them are so busy this week that they can hardly even be seen around the school.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.340
She's right, and it's not just S4.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:54.470
This is the time of year every student focuses on their own Aikatsu in preparation for the S4 Selection.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:07:00.690
Our only wish is to allow Yuzu-sama to dedicate herself in the same way for her music video.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:05.900
But outside of S4, who could manage to pair up with Yuzu-senpai?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.450
Do you have someone in mind?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.570
You should ask Lily-senpai!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.200
Yeah, she'd be the best.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:22.170
Hold on! I think there's something to your idea, but she's the total opposite of Yuzu-senpai.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.540
I understand your plight!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.210
Allow me, Saotome Ako, to volunteer—

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:32.300
But Lily-senpai's known Yuzu-senpai since they 
were little, and they're always on the same page!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.600
As I was saying, let Saotome Ako—

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:36.890
I've got it!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.770
I'll go and talk to Lily-senpai about it!

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:48.650
I see. And that is how you determined that I was the prime candidate.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.070
That's right.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:54.200
You were childhood friends with 
Yuzu-senpai, so you're the only one.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.870
I must decline.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.330
But why?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.580
I am part of Song Class.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:06.210
I have no right to interfere with the Aikatsu of Dance Class.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:10.420
But the Dance Class admins don't have anyone to turn to!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.970
Please do it.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.010
Lend them your help.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.470
If you would!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.680
Were it the American poet, Walt Whitman, he would say...

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.770
Huh?

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:27.940
"The sun warms most the man gripp'd by cold; {not even the Walt Whitman society of Japan knows where this is from, leading me to believe they just made shit up. therefore, I made shit up too}{apparently the Japanese version of this quote can be found in this book https://www.amazon.co.jp/%E5%90%8D%E8%A8%80%E5%90%8D%E5%8F%A5%E3%81%AE%E8%BE%9E%E5%85%B8-%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%81%E5%A0%82%E5%AE%9F%E7%94%A8-%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%81%E5%A0%82%E7%B7%A8%E4%BF%AE%E6%89%80/dp/4385142289, maybe it has further sourcing inside | also did your research bring you to this http://crd.ndl.go.jp/reference/modules/d3ndlcrdentry/index.php?page=ref_view&id=1000158771 ? because I think they really did just make shit up}

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:32.240
as he most troubled by life knows more its value."{also, only use know'st with thou, and also also, whitman does not write like that}

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:39.490
It is time for my Dress Make, so I must depart.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:47.790
That's the Tundra Diva for you. 
She's cool, through and through.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.380
Still...

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.630
What?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.260
I can't help but wonder.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:58.640
Were those really Lily-senpai's true feelings?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.600
That decides it!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.150
I'm going to try to convince Lily-senpai one more time!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.990
Beseech me to your hearts' content, but I will not budge. {this might've been the word I was looking for}

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.910
My answer remains the same.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:29.290
But isn't Yuzu-senpai your childhood friend, Lily-senpai?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.630
That is indeed the truth.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:35.220
And that friend of yours is in trouble!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.180
Please help her!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:44.180
Would I truly be of help to Yuzu 
were I to take the stage with her?

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:44.930
What?

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.810
Yuzu is the sun.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.820
The sun?

00:09:53.820 --> 00:10:00.870
She is the summer sun, illuminating the earth and providing strength to all its living beings.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:08.330
On the other hand, I am a dark winter cloud that assails the land with cold snow.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:13.960
If we took the stage together, I would only obscure Yuzu's allure.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:19.760
The sun shines brightest only in clear, blue skies.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.600
So those are your true feelings, Lily-senpai.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.610
But... I just can't accept that!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.320
It's... how do I put it...

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:40.490
You can only appreciate sunny days because there are times the sky clouds over.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.700
But if there's too much sun, it'd get too hot.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.870
Then that could lead to a drought, and nobody would want that!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:54.420
And besides, when you put salt on watermelon, it tastes even sweeter!{vanilla // salt de // burning love?}

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.510
That's not exactly right, but anyway!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:01.390
There are lots of opposites that go well together!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:05.890
You can draw out each other's charms, and compensate for the parts you lack.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.140
Yeah, like that!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.270
But most importantly, how do you yourself feel about it?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.360
If it was me...

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:22.070
I would want to sing together with my dear childhood friend.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:22.950
Because...

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:29.660
Because I've always wanted to perform with Koharu-chan, and I still do!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.010
Lily-senpai.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:44.350
Today has taken its toll on me. I would like to rest.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:47.600
I apologize, but I must ask you to leave.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.980
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.030
One, two—

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.070
Yuzu-sama.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.160
Mikki, Saaya!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.450
Um, Yuzu-sama.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:13.000
Some of the first-years such as Nijino-san suggested we look outside Dance Class, and went to ask Lily.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.500
So Lilienne's gonna come?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:19.630
No, it appears she respectfully declined.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.380
Oh, she did...

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.050
Well, what did you expect?

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:28.760
Lilienne's super busy getting her new brand all started up.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.430
I, Katsura Miki, have steeled my heart!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:36.230
I am prepared to accompany you to the extent of my ability, even if I should collapse on stage!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:40.780
And if Katsura-senpai collapses, waiting in the wings will be I, Akashi Saya!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.530
But if my precious admins collapsed, I'd be in a pickle.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.410
Precious?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.660
Admins...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:54.620
Without you two, I wouldn't get to shirk all my responsibilities!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.560
Wow, that was fun!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:19.650
You were splendid, Yuzu.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.490
Lilienne!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.740
Don't worry, this happens all the time.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.660
Don't push yourself.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.370
Thank you.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:35.000
Rest up for now, and when you get much much better later,

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.080
then you can sing and dance with me!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.250
Yes! One day, for sure!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.220
That promise...

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.270
I still have yet to fulfill it.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.480
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.860
I'd like to get this show on the road...

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:06.070
Now, where can I find Yuzu-chan's partner?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.110
Although we are not yet worthy...

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.740
We will don the mantle!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.330
Katsura-senpai, please make it through alive!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:16.370
You too, Saya-senpai.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.590
Is this going to be all right?

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:26.470
At this point, all we can do is pray for Katsura-senpai and Saya-senpai's bodies to hold out.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:29.760
I believe this situation calls for me...

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.520
A promise...

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.780
...is said to be an oath to oneself.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.360
Lily-senpai!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.660
You came for her!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:15:00.620
I, Shirogane Lily, have rushed here to stand as Nikaidou Yuzu's partner.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.290
Will you grant me this?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:12.300
That goes without saying! 
We welcome you with open arms!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.060
We believe that is Yuzu-sama's will as well.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:20.690
Whoa! It's a collaboration between Dance and Song Classes!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.560
I like it, I like it, I like it!

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:27.070
Lilienne! You came to dance with me?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:33.490
Yes. However, I fear that I may 
inadvertently cloud your radiance.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.580
When that happens...

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.490
Don't you fret!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:39.620
Um, what was it you used to say back then?

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:43.130
In the light, the darkness, alone...

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.540
What was it again?

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:51.340
Walking with a friend in the dark is better than walking alone in the light. {Helen Keller. this one is actually a real quote}{final-mente}

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.090
Yeah, that's the one!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.640
You truly have a smile like the sun.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.190
Fun is the best!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:10.150
Shirogane Lily, pouring my soul into this moment!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.240
And we got it!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.780
That's it! This is exactly what I wanted to capture.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:51.120
Your contrasting individualities brought out the best in each, raising you both to greater heights!{uh, oops? what did I hear?}

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.540
Contrasting individualities.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:59.460
We might have been too focused on chasing after Yuzu-sama.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.590
You're right.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:05.260
And despite realizing that, we were bound by our pride of Dance Class.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.270
But it's not all bad.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:12.100
We got to see something incredibly rare.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.100
Yes, we certainly did.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.270
That was astounding.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:22.570
Lily-senpai would normally never wear a pop dress like that.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:27.530
Despite having her own brand, 
she deliberately matched Yuzu-senpai.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:33.790
Yuzu-senpai wore the Hopping Animal Coord, blessed by the bright rays of the sun.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:41.210
To contrast, Lily-senpai wore the Night Safari Coord, emblematic of nature after dark.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:46.390
And due to their opposite colors, they drew out the best in each other's dresses. {apparently the traditional and modern definitions of "complementary colors" has changed}

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.970
That's our master of dresses, Lily-senpai!

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.470
She gets me going!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:55.020
You were wonderful, Lily.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.560
Allow me to thank you on behalf of Dance Class.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:02.110
No, I am the one who must be thanking you.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:08.280
Long ago, we made a promise to sing and dance together one day.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.790
As of this moment, we have fulfilled it.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.920
You must have remembered as well, Yuzu.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:17.170
You bet I did!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.250
I thank you sincerely, Yuzu.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:24.630
Ever since we were children, you have been my sun.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.050
You've got it backwards.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:32.430
Since we were kids, my fair-skinned dazzling Lilienne

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:35.560
has always been my sun!

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:48.620
Today was all sorts of overwhelming.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:51.830
I haven't felt like that about a performance in a long time.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:57.920
All of our senpai are doubling down on their Aikatsu for the S4 Selection.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.500
And me too...

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.130
I'm going to make it into S4!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:06.840
So will I.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:08.300
That's my line.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:11.890
We'll see who's laughing in the end.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.770
What are we waiting for?

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:16.350
Let's get back to our own Aikatsu!

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:17.890
I won't lose!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:20.980
Here we go!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:23.780
Aikatsu!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:14.140
It's the biggest event in a young girl's life: Valentine's Day!{I wouldn't've mound if you had used maiden}

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:17.180
Who should I give my chocolate to?

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:19.470
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

